msgstr "1. Opțional: Salvează-ți credențialele de acces {#1-optional-save-your-access-credentials}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Connect Qiskit with your service instance {#2-connect-qiskit-with-your-service-instance}"
msgstr "2. Conectează Qiskit cu instanța ta de serviciu {#2-connect-qiskit-with-your-service-instance}"

